  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut zucchini into thick half-moons. Thinly slice capsicum. Cut red onion into wedges. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Place zucchini, capsicum and onion on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f22605f9b700bf96fab83/step-6de5209b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook farfalle in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 10 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f22605f9b700bf96fab83/step-ea5bb69b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in cream, basil pesto and vegetable stock and cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins. Stir through pasta.\n• Add a splash of pasta water if the mixture seems dry. Add roasted veggies and baby spinach and toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f22605f9b700bf96fab83/step-b4051e2e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy pesto farfalle between bowls.\n• Top with crumbled fetta to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f22605f9b700bf96fab83/step-0633c3a4.jpg"
    }
  ]
